{"qid":"Q155361","names":["Rouran Khaganate"],"title":"Rouran Khaganate","endonym":null,"capsule":"The Rouran Khaganate was a nomadic confederation of the eastern Eurasian steppe that dominated the Mongolian plateau from 402, when Shelun proclaimed himself khagan, until 552, when the Turkic Ashina clan under Bumin rose in revolt and crushed Rouran power in a decisive defeat north of Huaihuang. At its height the Rouran controlled territory from Manchuria toward the Aral Sea region and conducted regular raids and diplomatic exchanges with the Northern Wei dynasty of China, extracting silk tribute payments and occasionally cooperating against mutual enemies. Some scholars identify the Rouran with the Pannonian Avars who migrated westward into Europe after the Göktürk destruction of the khaganate c. 552–555, though the identification remains debated.","attestation":"Boundaries from Seshat Cliopatria (Bennett et al., Scientific Data 2025; CC BY 4.0), digitized from standard historical atlases at ~0.07° resolution. Rouran territorial extent is conjectural, reconstructed from Chinese dynastic annals (Wei Shu, Bei Qi Shu) that describe raiding directions and tributary peoples but provide no cartographic data; steppe boundaries are broad estimates.","attestationLinks":[{"label":"Cliopatria dataset (Seshat, CC BY 4.0)","url":"https://github.com/Seshat-Global-History-Databank/cliopatria"},{"label":"Bennett et al. 2025, Scientific Data","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41597-025-04516-9"}],"citations":[{"label":"Wikipedia: Rouran Khaganate","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rouran_Khaganate"}],"britannica":"topic/Juan-juan","cowCode":null,"wikipedia":"Rouran Khaganate","rulers":[{"qid":null,"name":"Yujiulü Shelun (Qiudoufa Khagan)","nativeName":"郁久閭社崙","roman":"Yùjiǔlǘ Shèlún","start":402,"end":410,"image":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageLicense":null},{"qid":null,"name":"Yujiulü Hulü (Aikugai Khagan)","nativeName":"郁久閭斛律","roman":"Yùjiǔlǘ Húlǜ","start":410,"end":414,"image":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageLicense":null},{"qid":null,"name":"Yujiulü Buluzhen","nativeName":"郁久閭步鹿真","roman":"Yùjiǔlǘ Bùlùzhēn","start":414,"end":414,"image":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageLicense":null},{"qid":null,"name":"Yujiulü Datan (Mouhanheshenggai Khagan)","nativeName":"郁久閭大檀","roman":"Yùjiǔlǘ Dàtán","start":414,"end":429,"image":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageLicense":null},{"qid":null,"name":"Yujiulü Wuti (Chilian Khagan)","nativeName":"郁久閭吳提","roman":"Yùjiǔlǘ Wútí","start":429,"end":444,"image":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageLicense":null},{"qid":null,"name":"Yujiulü Tuhezhen (Chu Khagan)","nativeName":"郁久閭吐賀真","roman":"Yùjiǔlǘ Tǔhèzhēn","start":444,"end":464,"image":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageLicense":null},{"qid":null,"name":"Yujiulü Yucheng (Shouluobuzhen Khagan)","nativeName":"郁久閭予成","roman":"Yùjiǔlǘ Yúchéng","start":464,"end":485,"image":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageLicense":null},{"qid":null,"name":"Yujiulü Doulun (Fugudun Khagan)","nativeName":"郁久閭豆崙","roman":"Yùjiǔlǘ Dòulún","start":485,"end":492,"image":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageLicense":null},{"qid":null,"name":"Yujiulü Nagai (Houqifudaikezhe Khagan)","nativeName":"郁久閭那蓋","roman":"Yùjiǔlǘ Nàgài","start":492,"end":506,"image":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageLicense":null},{"qid":null,"name":"Yujiulü Futu (Tuohan Khagan)","nativeName":"郁久閭伏圖","roman":"Yùjiǔlǘ Fútú","start":506,"end":508,"image":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageLicense":null},{"qid":null,"name":"Yujiulü Chounu (Douluofubadoufa Khagan)","nativeName":"郁久閭丑奴","roman":"Yùjiǔlǘ Chǒunú","start":508,"end":520,"image":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageLicense":null},{"qid":null,"name":"Yujiulü Anagui (Chiliantoubingdoufa Khagan, first reign)","nativeName":"郁久閭阿那瓌","roman":"Yùjiǔlǘ Ānàguī","start":520,"end":521,"image":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageLicense":null},{"qid":null,"name":"Yujiulü Poluomen (Mioukesheju Khagan, rival)","nativeName":"郁久閭婆羅門","roman":"Yùjiǔlǘ Póluómén","start":521,"end":524,"image":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageLicense":null},{"qid":null,"name":"Yuj